From 7b3a21db7541ee0f70cf449cf46ee0e79c8d7ee9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Pedro Carvs <pedrocarvs26@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 17:23:46 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] ARM: configs: add gtelwifi_android_defconfig for Linux 7.4

Adds the verified working Android 17 / LineageOS 24 defconfig with:
- C Binder IPC and binderfs
- DISPC DRM and Lima Mali-400 GPU
- Built-in Broadcom FullMAC Wi-Fi (brcmfmac) and Bluetooth (btbcm/hci_uart)
- SC7730 CPU frequency scaling (schedutil) and SC2723 PMIC
---
